<title>FRANCE: Lapeyre falls on H1 profit drop.</title>
<headline>Lapeyre falls on H1 profit drop.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in building materials group Lapeyere fell sharply after it reported a drop in first half net attributable income which prompted downgrades by analysts for the full year.</p>
<p>At 1004 GMT, Lapeyre was down 4.13 percent at 267.00.</p>
<p>Lapeyre's first half profit was down 8.2 percent to 159 million francs.</p>
<p>&quot;Analysts have downgraded their forecasts for 1996 with seven to 10 percent,&quot; a trader said.</p>
</text>
